## Autonomous PR flow

Non-interactive PR operations with preflight gates:
1. `make pr-auto-check`
2. `make pr-auto`

`pr-auto` enforces:
1. feature-branch only (not `main`)
2. origin repo match (default from current directory via `PR_AUTO_EXPECTED_REPO`)
3. sanitized GitHub CLI auth env (ignores `GITHUB_TOKEN` overrides)
4. rebase/push + PR create/reuse + auto-merge request
   - if repo policy disables auto-merge, command reports and exits successfully
